WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:43.450
Being busy is not the same as producing a useful result. In the previous activity, you identified what is known and what remains unconfirmed in Daniel’s Monday requests. You will now use that information to prepare an executive support brief, the working document labelled T1.1 . Lindiwe’s decision meeting runs from 10:00 to 10:45 and concerns a service investment. Finance and operations supply the papers; Daniel coordinates the pack and preparation. In this activity, you will identify what the pack must contain, who supplies each input and what evidence shows that it is ready. You can complete your own T1.1 draft beside the lesson.
